pro_course_detail.description:
For you guys who want someone to talk to in Portuguese while:

. learning useful words and expressions;
. getting tips on how you can understand Brazilians better;
. improving your pronunciation and;
. getting some of your mistakes fixed.

All during class!

Para brasileiros que querem alguém pra conversar em inglês e querem durante a aula:

. aprender novas palavras e frases úteis;
. ter dicas de como entender os norte-americanos melhor;
. melhorar a pronúncia e;
. ter alguns dos seus erros corrigidos.

For you guys who would like to improve your Portuguese as a whole: 

. speak well;
. understand everything you read and hear and;
. have a very understandable pronunciation if not a native-like Brazilian accent.

These classes have a course format and are customized as much as possible to your level, hobbies, profession, learning style and personality. They also have in-built spaced repetition in which you learn a+b, then a+b+c and so on, so it really helps with memorization. I teach them in packages of 10 classes, for 60 min / 2x a week on iTalki. However, 10 classes are not enough to complete this course since our goal here is for you to get to fluency, have very good listening skills and very good pronunciation. We know it doesn't happen overnight, right? So, after 10 classes let me know if you'd like to have another package of 10 classes or you may ask me to make you a permanent student for the time we need to achieve our goals above. 

Do not hesitate to ask in case you have any questions about this course.

For you guys who want someone to talk to in Portuguese while:

. learning useful words and expressions;
. getting tips on how you can understand Brazilians better;
. improving your pronunciation and;
. getting some of your mistakes fixed.

All during class!
